"gitch saves a backup before pull, up, sync, fix, undo and amend, and keeps the 30 most recent." = "gitch 会在 pull、up、sync、fix、undo 和 amend 之前保存备份，并保留最近 30 个。";
"gitch sets the commit author to %@ and points origin (and upstream) at %@'s SSH alias, then locks the repository to it." = "gitch 会将提交作者设为 %1$@，把 origin（和 upstream）指向 %2$@ 的 SSH 别名，然后将仓库锁定到该账户。";
"gitch stops requiring %@ for commits and pushes here. The commit author stays as it is." = "在此仓库提交和推送时将不再要求使用 %1$@。提交作者设置保持不变。";
"gitch sync: brings this branch up to date with the original repository (upstream)." = "gitch sync：将此分支更新为原始仓库（upstream）的最新状态。";
"gitch up: moves this branch onto the latest default branch, or merges it if the branch is already pushed. A backup is saved first." = "gitch up：将此分支移到最新的默认分支之上；如果该分支已推送，则改为合并。会先保存备份。";
